"The Ritual of Return is a ship's emergency teleport spell toward a Contract's world."
"It must be legally authorized, as Loh Alis-art'h authorized Alden Thorn's."
"The whole teleportation chamber, sand-floored and flame-lit, serves as its focus."
"Five Artonans power the chamber."
"It is worse than a Contract-to-Contract teleport and unsafe for the weak."
"The receiving Contract takes over on arrival, trying to preserve the passenger's haecceity."
"A Contract ranks passengers; if cost and risk exceed thresholds, it destroys the Ritual."
"Mother, the Artona I kernel, can re-prioritize a passenger and save the Ritual."
